        "Halo",
        "the ring",
        "this ring"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Setting",
      "content": "The year is 2552. Humanity's UNSC is losing a long war against the Covenant, an alliance of alien species bent on wiping humans out. After the fall of Reach, the cruiser Pillar of Autumn fled blindly and found Halo: an enormous ring-shaped artificial world orbiting the gas giant Threshold, with its own sky, seas, forests, and snow, built by an unknown ancient race. The Autumn's survivors came down on the ring in lifeboats, and the Covenant followed them.",
