      "key": [
        "Covenant",
        "Prophets",
        "Great Journey"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Covenant",
      "content": "The Covenant is a theocratic alliance of alien species led by the Prophets, who preach that the ancient ring-builders' relics will carry the faithful on the Great Journey. Elites command; Grunts make up the numbers; Jackals are mercenaries with energy shields; Hunters are armored giants that fight in pairs. They use plasma weapons, energy swords, Ghosts, Banshees, and Wraiths.",
